{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/General.gif?t=1741948423\" />Explore a whimsical small open world as ILA, a spirited young witch-in-training. Start your journey fueled by determination, your trusty skatebroom, and a mission to find your lost kitty, Coco. Discover secret places, collect valuable items, and improve your magical flying abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/Glide_Around.png?t=1741948423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/GlideAround.gif?t=1741948423\" />Who needs a broom when you have a skatebroom? Soar through snowy mountains and enchanted forests, feel the wind as you cross stunning landscapes. Master and upgrade the magic of your to soar higher and farther.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/discover_secret_places.png?t=1741948423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/Discover.gif?t=1741948423\" />Explore ILA\u2019s small open world at your own pace and relax. Find hidden nooks, uncover treasures, and unlock secrets flying on your skatebroom. Each discovery rewards you with valuable items and deeper lore, enriching your magical journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/witchy_customization.png?t=1741948423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/Customization.gif?t=1741948423\" />Collect special items and coins to personalize ILA\u2019s outfit with stylish hats, capes, and skatebrooms to reflect your unique style. As you progress, access new skatebroom upgrades to improve ILA\u2019s flying powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/immersive_soundtrack.png?t=1741948423\" />Feel the magic and enjoy the captivating original soundtrack composed by Joaquim Scandurra (Sku), which builds and grows with you as you approach the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/wishlist_follow_steam.gif?t=1741948423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1560160?t=1741948423","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1560160?t=1741948423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741948423","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741948423","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/General.gif?t=1741948423\" />Explore a whimsical small open world as ILA, a spirited young witch-in-training. Start your journey fueled by determination, your trusty skatebroom, and a mission to find your lost kitty, Coco. Discover secret places, collect valuable items, and improve your magical flying abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/Glide_Around.png?t=1741948423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/GlideAround.gif?t=1741948423\" />Who needs a broom when you have a skatebroom? Soar through snowy mountains and enchanted forests, feel the wind as you cross stunning landscapes. Master and upgrade the magic of your to soar higher and farther.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/discover_secret_places.png?t=1741948423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/Discover.gif?t=1741948423\" />Explore ILA\u2019s small open world at your own pace and relax. Find hidden nooks, uncover treasures, and unlock secrets flying on your skatebroom. Each discovery rewards you with valuable items and deeper lore, enriching your magical journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/witchy_customization.png?t=1741948423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/Customization.gif?t=1741948423\" />Collect special items and coins to personalize ILA\u2019s outfit with stylish hats, capes, and skatebrooms to reflect your unique style. As you progress, access new skatebroom upgrades to improve ILA\u2019s flying powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/e